WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.626 --> 00:00:05.255
We're about to take a
 nice 15 day cruise.

00:00:16.599 --> 00:00:18.518
We were assured that it 
was not a problem.

00:00:18.518 --> 00:00:20.645
This thing was spreading 
through the boat.

00:00:26.151 --> 00:00:29.237
Fourteen days in a 
room that's four by three.

00:00:40.874 --> 00:00:43.126
The Diamond Princess 
was ground zero.

00:00:43.126 --> 00:00:44.377
The U.S. officials debate 

00:00:44.377 --> 00:00:46.463
whether to bring
 the Americans back.

00:00:46.463 --> 00:00:49.090
You need to get us off this ship
before we all get sick and die.

00:00:49.090 --> 00:00:50.216
It's very intense.

00:00:50.675 --> 00:00:53.386
And they said, "Okay, just 
people who don't have Covid."

00:00:53.636 --> 00:00:54.429
"How are you feeling?"

00:00:54.429 --> 00:00:55.889
They didn't know 
who had the Covid.

00:00:55.889 --> 00:00:57.182
That was the 
medical examination.

00:00:58.266 --> 00:00:59.893
Our team went on board.

00:00:59.893 --> 00:01:02.896
They started to load all America
for transport to the airport.

00:01:03.188 --> 00:01:04.731
On the way to the airplane,

00:01:04.731 --> 00:01:06.649
test results
would come back positive.

00:01:06.691 --> 00:01:08.735
Pandemonium ensues.

00:01:08.735 --> 00:01:10.820
The president is just furious.

00:01:10.820 --> 00:01:12.072
Our numbers are going to go up.

00:01:12.072 --> 00:01:15.450
They didn't know how to handle
a single cruise ship.

00:01:15.825 --> 00:01:16.951
They can't get that right.

00:01:16.951 --> 00:01:18.661
How are they going
to get the rest of this right?

00:01:18.661 --> 00:01:20.205
Carnival knew that 
there was a pandemic.

00:01:20.205 --> 00:01:21.873
To our horror,

00:01:21.873 --> 00:01:24.209
we realized there were many more
cruise ships out there.

00:01:24.209 --> 00:01:26.086
Why did the cruise 
ships keep sailing?

